\[
\text{Amplitude} = \sqrt{3^2 + 2^2} = \sqrt{9 + 4} = \sqrt{13}
\]
The period is:
\[
\text{Period} = \frac{2\pi}{\omega} = \frac{2\pi}{2} = \pi
\]
