\[ \sqrt{(3 - p)^2 + (m - 0)^2} = 5 \]
\[ (3 - p)^2 + m^2 = 25 \]
Substituting $m^2 = 6p$, we get:
\[ (3 - p)^2 + 6p = 25 \]
\[ 9 - 6p + p^2 + 6p = 25 \]
\[ p^2 = 16 \]
