$$ a_6 = 19 + 5(-4) = 19 - 20 = -1 < 0. $$
Thus, the common difference is $-4$.

However, if $d = -5$, then:
$$ a_5 = 19 + 4(-5) = 19 - 20 = -1 < 0. $$
This contradicts the condition that $a_5 > 0$.

