\]

Substituting \( I \) into the deflection equation:

\[
\delta_{\text{max}} = \frac{P L^3}{3 E \left( \frac{b t^3}{12} \right)} = \frac{P L^3}{3 E b t^3} \times 12 = \frac{4 P L^3}{E b t^3}
