\[
\sum_l \langle n|S^\dagger S|m\rangle = \langle n|1|m\rangle = \delta_{mn}.
\]  
This confirms that the sum over all possible intermediate states \(l\) gives the Kronecker delta \(\delta_{mn}\).  

