\[
Q_d = \sqrt{2 \epsilon_s q N_D} \left( \frac{V_{BS}}{2} \right)^{1/2}
\]
where \(\epsilon_s\) is the permittivity of silicon (\(11.7 \times 10^{-11} \text{ F/m}\)).

